Package: open-orion
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Open Orion <4matthedev@gmail.com>
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.34), libtcl8.6, libtk8.6
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/4matthedev/open-orion
Description: Autonomous terminal-based AI agent (JARVIS-style)
 Natural-language to safe shell commands with a guarded, confirmation-based
 execution flow. Uses local Ollama models or OpenAI/Anthropic cloud APIs.